        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_903ba7126bb649c9916187ed007ac334",
      "statement": "The UI evaluates cooldown before enrolled-status, so a user whose Last_Withdrawal_Date is recent but who somehow has a non-blank Current_Plan is shown as Cooldown rather than Enrolled. Consequently an enrolled re-enrollment row (states 5 and 10) must have Last_Withdrawal_Date >6 months ago or it would wrongly mask the enrolled status.",
