    {
      "id": "claim_724b4dd911a04b3e983278e3733791fe",
      "statement": "Withdrawal_Count ticks up only in processWithdrawal, which increments it (currentWdCount + 1) and sets Last_Withdrawal_Date = today while clearing Current_Plan and Investment_Plan. processEnrollment does not touch Withdrawal_Count on an existing row (it only sets it to 0 when appending a brand-new row), so it holds steady through each enrollment.",
      "evidence": [
