    {
      "id": "claim_179f34b4761e418fa5b8633d3a9c12bf",
      "statement": "processWithdrawal does not refuse the 3rd withdrawal — it simply increments Withdrawal_Count to 3. The permanent lockout (Withdrawal_Count >= 3, state 6) therefore takes effect on the next enroll attempt as evaluated by populateUI, not at withdrawal time.",
