    {
      "id": "claim_5f94d525c8774f02a6b332b3dd2a3ab6",
      "statement": "First_Enrolled_Date is set once on first enrollment and never overwritten; its emptiness drives the wasFirstEnrollment flag in processEnrollment (true only when First_Enrolled_Date was empty), which in turn drives the membership-start date in the confirmation letter (Hire_Date on first enrollment, else the re-enrollment date today). A blank First_Enrolled_Date on an already-enrolled member causes a wrong-date bug on the next re-enrollment.",
