    {
      "id": "claim_f8fdbdfff49f45e491fd4e57c88e9345",
      "statement": "A transaction is pending/cancellable only if its Action is in [Enroll, Change Plan, Withdraw] (CANCELLABLE_ACTIONS), its latest Event_Type is SUBMITTED or EDITED, and isWithinEditableWindow(submittedAt) is true. getPendingTransactions derives the in-progress box purely from Audit_Log (no Pending_Transactions sheet): it keeps the latest row per Transaction_ID by Timestamp, then filters by the three conditions, and returns {transactionId, type, description, submittedAt, editableUntil, currentValues: eventData.newValues}. The editableUntil deadline is the next upcoming 15th at 23:59:59 Asia/Bangkok (getEditableUntil), computed explicitly in Bangkok time.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Code/Profile.gs#L188-L254",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f03b27aabea5516fc1f121a7c73005b14837ba4abf1e4827c9a0969149e6685d:"
