    {
      "id": "claim_1cca105496bc43a7839b302fa8b0f5b6",
      "statement": "Beneficiary and investment-plan changes are effective immediately (no payroll cut-off, no cancellable state) and are deliberately excluded from the in-progress table even though they log a SUBMITTED row. Only the three payroll-deduction actions (Enroll, Change Plan, Withdraw) are cancellable.",
