    {
      "id": "claim_ee5f34b8813040599406aaf344e1495d",
      "statement": "cancelTransaction reverts the affected Enrollments fields from priorValues captured at SUBMITTED time and appends a CANCELLED row with the same Transaction_ID. It re-checks isWithinEditableWindow and ownership before reverting, and the revert is per action type: Enroll restores First_Enrolled_Date, Current_Enrolled_Date, Current_Plan, Investment_Plan (blank if first-ever); Change Plan restores Current_Plan and clears Last_Plan_Change_Date; Withdraw restores Withdrawal_Count, clears Last_Withdrawal_Date, and restores Current_Plan + Investment_Plan. No penalty side-effects (plan-change lock, withdrawal count, re-enrollment cooldown) remain after a cancel.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Code/Action.gs#L522-L661",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b9f241207052d599b202d845fea5a6c903b7151221bbbd5826468d81fa874738:"
