        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1ca05b796999431ebcfe43646327397e",
      "statement": "Event_Type is documented as SUBMITTED / CANCELLED / EDITED, and getPendingTransactions accepts a latest event of SUBMITTED or EDITED, but no current handler writes an EDITED row — editing a pending transaction was dropped from the In Progress Pending Transactions proposal (users cancel and resubmit). The EDITED branch is retained so a future edit feature slots in without changing the cancellation-window derivation; today the live lifecycle is SUBMITTED -> (cancel) -> CANCELLED, or SUBMITTED -> window closes -> committed.",
