    {
      "id": "claim_a9201b08c154461b8ef87e4a9ca990fa",
      "statement": "patchAuditEventData(transactionId, eventType, extraFields) is the one operation that mutates an existing Audit_Log row in place: it scans bottom-up for the row matching both Transaction_ID and Event_Type, JSON.parses the Event_Data, merges in post-commit stamps (emailSent, emailError, letterFileId, letterError, signedAt), and writes the stringified result back. It is wrapped in try/catch and never throws because it runs after the action already succeeded.",
      "evidence": [
