    {
      "id": "claim_06058dc9873e468e895c5d1274f38124",
      "statement": "processChangePlan is the one server-side gate actually enforced at write time (unlike probation/cooldown/lockout which are client-side only): it re-derives mostRecentAction from max(Last_Plan_Change_Date, Current_Enrolled_Date), adds 6 months, and returns a failure with the next-eligible date if the window has not opened. checkPlanChangeEligibility does the same pre-computation on page load for the locked modal variant.",
