      "id": "claim_297e186d963e482a8e535eaaeda52490",
      "statement": "When a pending Enroll transaction exists, populateUI shows the status pill as a dash rather than the enrolled label, and the Your Plan info field as a dash for any pending transaction, so the dashboard does not visually confirm a not-yet-effective change. The In Progress box itself renders each pending transaction with its bilingual description, submitted/cancellable-until timestamps, and a Cancel button.",
